WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:07.049
♪♪

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.592
Lynsey:
I just never thought I would
come back here.

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:11.011
You don't got love for this
city?

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:14.139
♪♪

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:14.973
Lynsey:
It's not the city.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.184
Lynsey:
It's that house.

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.518
♪♪

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.978
I'm the only one that made it
out.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.690
♪♪

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.691
Lynsey:
I-I got a job.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:26.235
Gloria:
You did, doing what?

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:27.236
Lynsey:
Cleaning pools.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.820
What are you doing?

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.322
Pools.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:31.323
(Smacks lips)

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:32.115
Cleaning them.

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:36.245
James:
Look, if it get dark, now, you
just, you just ride it.

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:36.662
Okay?

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:37.746
Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.166
How do I do that?

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.084
(Chuckles)

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:45.837
♪♪

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.131
Alright, uh, what’s dark?

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.758
♪♪

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.677
Lynsey:
I work for the Army Corp of
Engineers.

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:54.096
Lynsey:
Now I need them to clear me so I
can go back.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:56.098
You got blown up over there and
you wanna’ go back?

00:00:56.139 --> 00:01:00.519
♪I've got to get away from here
somehow.♪

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:01.770
♪I don't know know where I'm
gonna go.♪

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.604
What happened?

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:05.107
James:
I was in a car accident on the
causeway.

00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:07.025
♪Whoa you just don't care.?

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.902
Lynsey:
I’m kind of on a lot of
medication.

00:01:08.986 --> 00:01:09.820
James:
What kind of medication?

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.030
Like ‘don’t shoot yourself in
the head’ kind of medication. 

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.657
Okay.

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:14.741
♪♪

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.953
♪I've got to get myself
together,♪

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:23.458
♪I gotta get through the stormy
weather.♪

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.752
♪I got to get away.♪

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.380
Dr. Lucas:
Can you go back? Yes.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.549
Dr. Lucas:
Should you got back?

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:32.509
It's a different question.

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:34.553
♪Whoa, I just gotta get
away.♪

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:38.890
James:
How the pool business going?

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.059
It's cut-throat.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.144
♪♪

00:01:42.144 --> 00:01:42.894
Really?

00:01:44.021 --> 00:01:45.647
No.

